<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-WOMEN'S STYRIA OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WOMEN'S STYRIA OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MARIA LANKOWITZ, Austria 1997-08-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results</p>
<p>at the women's $107,500 Styria Open tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Saturday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>6-Henrieta Nagyova (Slovakia) beat Meike Babel (Germany) 6-1</p>
<p>7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>5-Barbara Schett (Austria) beat Maria Sanchez-Lorenzo (Spain) 6-4 6-1</p>
</text>
